%% SQ-06 Eligibility evaluation, weighted matching and ranking
%% Services: ScholarshipEligibilityService, ScholarshipMatchingService,
%%           ScholarshipRecommendationService
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant C as Student\ScholarshipController
    participant MS as ScholarshipMatchingService
    participant ES as ScholarshipEligibilityService
    participant DB as MariaDB

    S->>C: GET /student/scholarships/{scholarship}/eligibility
    C->>ES: evaluate(profile, scholarship)
    loop each of five criteria
        ES->>ES: evaluateGwa / evaluateFamilyIncome / evaluateProgram / evaluateYearLevel / evaluateEnrollmentStatus
        Note over ES: unconfigured criterion -> NOT_APPLICABLE (not a failure)
        Note over ES: missing student value -> NOT_MET (mandatory)
        Note over ES: otherwise MET / NOT_MET with student value, required value, reason
    end
    ES->>ES: overall = NOT_ELIGIBLE if any mandatory NOT_MET else ELIGIBLE
    ES-->>C: EligibilityEvaluationResult (criteria[], overall, summary)
    C-->>S: per-criterion explanation + overall verdict

    S->>C: GET /student/scholarships/recommendations
    C->>MS: recommendForStudent(profile)
    MS->>DB: SELECT active matching weights (fallback to defaults)
    MS->>DB: SELECT availableForStudents() with requirements
    MS->>DB: SELECT student's existing applications (document readiness)

    loop each available scholarship
        MS->>ES: evaluate(profile, scholarship, application)
        alt overall NOT_ELIGIBLE
            MS->>MS: classify = NOT_ELIGIBLE, attach failing mandatory reasons
        else ELIGIBLE
            MS->>MS: factor scores — academic, financial, program, year level (binary)
            MS->>MS: factor score — document readiness = ready / required
            Note over MS: during document_verification / approved only verified docs count as ready
            MS->>MS: score = sum(factor x weight) / sum(applicable weights)
            MS->>MS: match_percentage = round(score x 100, 2)
            MS->>MS: classify = ELIGIBLE_RECOMMENDATION | POTENTIAL_MATCH
        end
    end

    MS->>MS: sort score desc, deadline asc, title asc, id asc
    MS-->>C: ranked ScholarshipMatchResult collection
    C-->>S: recommendation cards + full match list

    Note over C,MS: Weights must total 100 (tolerance 0.01) or the<br/>admin configuration is refused before it is stored (FR-MATCH-03).
